   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It is hard to know what is going on without seeing the code, but I am guessing that the data file that srcfile.R is trying to read isn&#39;t being found.  I would look within that file to make sure that all the files that you are accessing are in the same directory as your ui.R and server.R files.  Your comment about sourcing the file manually by hand ahead of running the app resulting in different behavior than starting with a fresh R process and simply running an application is also suspicious.  A completely random guess here would be that you may have two srcfile.R files, one that is in the working directory that you are in, and the other that is with the ui.R and server.R files.  Again, total guess here.  <div><br></div><div>Hope this helps.</div></div>"
    ],
